    {
      "name": "Agent: Evaluate Client Reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        -464,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=The client replied to a review email containing N short clips. Their reply is below. Decide PER CLIP what they want.\n\nPossible actions per clip: approve, skip, regenerate.\nAlso extract: publish_when (immediate / scheduled / null) and a regenerate_focus (string or null).\n\nIf ambiguous, default to skip.\n\nOutput STRICT JSON:\n{ \"decisions\": [ { \"clip_id\": \"<id>\", \"action\": \"approve|skip|regenerate\", \"publish_when\": \"immediate|scheduled|null\", \"regenerate_focus\": \"<text>|null\" } ] }\n\n=== CLIENT REPLY ===\n{{ $json.text || $json.snippet || '' }}\n=== END ===",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model (for Agent)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
