        "content": "## Regenerate branch ✓\n\nBuilt 2026-05-25 (Block 4). Flow: Klap GET project → resubmit new task with `max_clip_count: 7` (bumped to nudge different selection) → poll → get clips → log → Gmail re-review email.\n\nNote: Klap doesn't accept a 'focus_intent' field in submit, so `regenerate_focus` from the email-reply agent is only stored in the sheet for human reference, not sent to Klap.",
